      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ibn Mahboub, from Abu Ayoub, from Al Fuzayl Bin Yasaar, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>: ‘The one who accepts upon himself in the presence of the Imam<sup>asws</sup> with a right of someone from the rights of the Muslims, so it is not upon the Imam<sup>asws</sup> that he<sup>asws</sup> should established the Penalty (<span class=\"iTxt\">Hadd</span>) upon him, the one who accepted with it in his<sup>asws</sup> presence, until the owner of the right is present, or his guardian, so he seeks his right’."
        ]
      }
